{
  "$comment": [
    "Smoke variant of eval_full — every experiment / scenario combination at",
    "n_seeds=1 so we get through every test case once without paying the full",
    "campaign's wallclock cost.  Used to validate the full eval pipeline end-to-end:",
    "every grid, every scenario kind, every variant, every ablation, and every",
    "sweep is exercised at least once.  When this passes cleanly, eval_full.json",
    "with its full seed counts is safe to submit to SLURM.",
    "",
    "Architectural coverage as of 2026-05: the ablation matrix exercises every",
    "enable_* flag on RestorationConfiguration including the L2.5 mesh",
    "(holon_summary, holon_coalition, cross_sector_coalitions), Concept-C dynamic",
    "topology (dynamic_holon_topology, dynamic_cp_topology), tier-stratified ADMM,",
    "line-loading constraint, and reconfig feasibility ranking.  An additional",
    "sweep covers community_partition_method (label propagation vs",
    "distributed-Louvain modularity) so that branch is exercised too."
  ],
  "name": "eval_full_smoke_60s",
  "out_root": "experiment/_runs/eval",
  "simulation_duration_s": 60.0,
  "task_timeout_s": 2400.0,
  "failure_delay_s_max": 1.0,
  "write_timeseries": true,
  "timestamp_dir": true,
  "defaults": {
    "runs_per_grid": 1,
    "failure_lambda": 1.5,
    "max_failures": 4
  },
  "experiments": [
