    {
      "$comment": [
        "Ablation matrix split into themed blocks so every flag is paired",
        "with a scenario that can actually exercise it.  Audit (2026-05) found",
        "the original single-scenario design left ~14/22 flags inert because",
        "their gating conditions (CPs, voltage stress, heat sector, line",
        "overload, Hebbian warmup, etc.) never fired on the concentrated-5",
        "LV scenario.  Each block below names the flag-set it tests + the",
        "scenario that triggers them; the {} default in each block is the",
        "per-block baseline to subtract from."
      ],
      "name": "ablation_core",
      "$comment_block": "Holonic / QP-gossip / priority core.  Concentrated 5-failure on simbench_lv with skewed priorities + slack 0.45 produces a deficit that drives the holon ADMM, gossip, and priority allocation paths.",
      "grids": [
        "simbench_lv"
      ],
      "n_seeds": 1,
      "variants": [
        "scare"
      ],
      "ablations": [
        {},
        {
          "enable_holonic": false,
          "enable_cp_admm": false
        },
        {
          "enable_holonic": false
        },
        {
          "enable_qp_gossip": false
        },
        {
          "enable_priority_holon_allocation": false
        },
        {
          "enable_tier_stratified_holon_admm": false
        },
        {
          "enable_monotonic_floor": true
        },
        {
          "enable_distributed_failure_notice": false
        },
        {
          "enable_dynamic_holon_topology": false
        }
      ],
      "scenarios": [
        {
          "kind": "clean",
          "failure_type": "concentrated",
          "n_failures": 5,
          "priority_assignment": "skewed",
          "slack_budget_pct": 0.45
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "$comment_block": "Cross-sector / CP layer.  cp_heavy_dependent grid with generator failures and tight slack (0.15) is the regime where CP ADMM, dynamic CP filtering, and cross-sector coalitions matter â€” the only restoration path is through the CP layer.",
      "name": "ablation_cross_sector",
      "grids": [
        "simbench_lv_cp_heavy_dependent"
      ],
      "n_seeds": 1,
      "variants": [
        "scare"
      ],
      "ablations": [
        {},
        {
          "enable_cp_admm": false
        },
        {
          "enable_dynamic_cp_topology": false
        },
        {
          "enable_cross_sector_coalitions": true
        },
        {
          "enable_holon_coalition": true,
          "enable_cross_sector_coalitions": true
        },
        {
          "enable_holon_summary": false,
          "enable_holon_coalition": false,
          "enable_cross_sector_coalitions": false
        }
      ],
      "scenarios": [
        {
          "kind": "clean",
          "failure_type": "generator",
          "max_failures": 3,
          "priority_assignment": "skewed",
          "slack_budget_pct": 0.15
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "$comment_block": "Line-loading / constraint-aware path.  line_stress scenario with load_scale=1.8 and ampacity_scale=0.5 forces lines into overload, which is the only regime where line_loading_constraint, constraint_aware_gossip, multihop_constraint, and curtailment_auction all fire.",
      "name": "ablation_line_stress",
      "grids": [
        "simbench_lv"
      ],
      "n_seeds": 1,
      "variants": [
        "scare"
      ],
      "ablations": [
        {},
        {
          "enable_line_loading_constraint": false
        },
        {
          "enable_constraint_aware_gossip": false
        },
        {
          "enable_multihop_constraint": false
        },
        {
          "enable_curtailment_auction": false
        }
      ],
      "scenarios": [
        {
          "kind": "line_stress",
          "load_scale": 1.8,
          "ampacity_scale": 0.5,
          "max_failures": 2,
          "priority_assignment": "skewed",
          "slack_budget_pct": 0.45
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "$comment_block": "Voltage support.  pv_peak scenario pushes vm_pu past the 1.03 pu deadband so the Q-V droop role actually fires â€” concentrated load failures never trigger it.",
      "name": "ablation_voltage",
      "grids": [
        "simbench_lv"
      ],
      "n_seeds": 1,
      "variants": [
        "scare"
      ],
      "ablations": [
        {},
