    {
      "$comment": [
        "Cross-sector coalition pillar (L2.5).  Mirrors cp_coalition_eval's headline",
        "ablation on simbench_lv_cp_heavy_dependent â€” CPs replace primary generation, so",
        "losing a CP is unrecoverable by intra-sector gossip + local-gen fallback alone.  Tight",
        "slack budget (15%) + generator-class failures make the cross-sector layer the",
        "only path to recovery.  Three rows: full stack vs xs-off vs all-coalitions-off",
        "so the smoke exercises every L2.5 code path."
      ],
